  "description": "The Monkey King’s journey was over. But a new story begins with an impossible crime -- his master, Sanzang, has gone missing. His new mission is to dive into the Murim, a world where mortals and their martial arts rival the power of the gods and unravel this mystery. The threads of fate reveal not only allies, but foes from his past. The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal has been unchained, but this new arduous journey may yet prove to be his most challenging yet... \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
